{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-07-27 11:00:00', 'title': 'PHOTO RELEASE — HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES ANNOUNCES KIMBERLY LEBAK AS NEW PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER OF N3B JOINT VENTURE', 'text': 'NEWPORT NEWS, VA., JULY 27, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES (NYSE: HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT KIMBERLY LEBAK OF ITS TECHNICAL SOLUTIONS DIVISION HAS BEEN NAMED PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER OF HII NUCLEAR-LED JOINT VENTURE NEWPORT NEWS NUCLEAR BWXT-LOS ALAMOS (N3B).'}